<!-- ACE section -->
<div class="ml-feature-section-nine pt-80 pb-100 mt-40 md-pt-60 md-pb-60 border-top">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="title-style-seven text-center pb-10 lg-pb-20">
            <h2 class="title">Assess - Classes - Expert </h2>
            <p>Make your child ACE with MANAS Learning</p>
        </div>

        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-4 col-sm-6">
                <a href="#" class="theme-btn-three" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#myModal1">
                    <div class="card-style-nine nineone md-mb-10 md-pb-20">
                        <div class="img-holder d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center">
                            <img src="~/main/images/assets/assess-img.png" alt="Child Assessment">
                        </div>
                        <h3>Assess</h3>
                        <p>Assess your child to understand your child’s level in reading, writing, spelling, math, attention, etc.</p>
                        <a href="#" class="theme-btn-three" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#myModal1">
                            Learn more <i class="fas fa-angle-right"></i>
                        </a>

                    </div>
                </a>
                <div class="modal fade" id="myModal1">
                    <div class="modal-dialog modal-xl modal-dialog-centered">
                        <div class="modal-content box1 p-3">

                            <!-- Modal Header -->
                            <div class="modal-header border-bottom-0">
                                <h4 class="modal-title">Assess</h4>
                                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal"></button>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Modal body -->
                            <div class="modal-body">
                                <img class="modalimg" src="~/main/images/assets/assess-img.png" alt="Child Classroom">
                                <p>
                                    Assess your child's specific learning disabilities with simple tests. Determine the differences in learning abilities and identify their strengths.
                                </p>
                                <p>
                                    It is especially important to understand the learning styles and severity of the learning disability in a child. Each child has a different level of perception. Assessing these different abilities help to identify problems like Dyslexia, Dysgraphia, Dyscalculia, Dysorthographia, Dyspraxia, etc. To extend an effective educational plan and helpful techniques to a child, we must understand and accept the strengths and weaknesses. It is crucial to provide personalized classes that target the specific learning disabilities of the kid and nourish their strengths.
                                </p>
                                <p>
                                    Concentration, memory, and attention also play key roles in fuelling academic performances. Every individual has varied neural functioning that impacts developmental processes. Assessment done via specifically designed tests by experts can help to recognize the child’s performance. These results can be eventually utilized to curate special instructions and accordingly customized sessions that guide a child better.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-4 col-sm-6">
                <a href="#" class="theme-btn-three" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#myModal2">
