                        <p class="pe-xxl-5">Subscribe to our classes to bring out the genius in your child.</p>
                        <a href="#" class="theme-btn-three" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#myModal2"> Learn more <i class="fas fa-angle-right"></i></a>

                    </div>
                </a>
                <div class="modal fade" id="myModal2">
                    <div class="modal-dialog modal-xl modal-dialog-centered">
                        <div class="modal-content box2 p-3">

                            <!-- Modal Header -->
                            <div class="modal-header border-bottom-0">
                                <h4 class="modal-title">Classes</h4>
                                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal"></button>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Modal body -->
                            <div class="modal-body">
                                <img class="modalimg" src="~/main/images/assets/classes-img.png" alt="Child Classroom">
                                <p>
                                    Join our classes to aim at better learning that brings out the best in your child.
                                </p>
                                <p>
                                    Often children tend to lag in skills that they should have acquired in their early years, due to different learning disabilities. In conventional classrooms, the methods of teaching and the perception levels of children are generalized. Thus, children tend to lack in reading, writing, math, spelling, etc. Often, some children lose interest in academics. At MANAS Learning, classes are personalized as per the child’s learning styles. Based on the previously conducted assessments, a child gets an individualized educational plan with fun activities. We create sessions based on the strengths and weaknesses of the child.
                                </p>
                                <p>
                                    The IEPs are specifically curated to help a child’s severity of Dyslexia, Dysgraphia, Dyscalculia, Visual Perception disorder, Auditory processing disorder, ADHD, Autism, etc. The focus is to nourish the strengths to engage and inspire. The aim is to deliver age-based skills and basic knowledge than syllabus-based education. One-on-one classes help personalize and focus on the child. Multi-sensory methods are blended into exciting games and activities redefining learning for children.
                                </p>
                            </div>

                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-4 col-sm-6">
                <a href="#" class="theme-btn-three" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#myModal3">
