                        <h3>Expert</h3>
                        <p class="pe-xxl-5">Get a free consultation from our experts to help your child excel in academics.</p>
                        <a href="#" class="theme-btn-three" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#myModal3">Learn more <i class="fas fa-angle-right"></i></a>

                    </div>
                </a>
                <div class="modal fade" id="myModal3">
                    <div class="modal-dialog modal-xl modal-dialog-centered">
                        <div class="modal-content box3 p-3">

                            <!-- Modal Header -->
                            <div class="modal-header border-bottom-0">
                                <h4 class="modal-title">Expert</h4>
                                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal"></button>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Modal body -->
                            <div class="modal-body">
                                <img class="modalimg" src="~/main/images/assets/expert-img.png" alt="Free Expert Consultation">
                                <p>
                                    Engage in rewarding learning experiences with our experts. Our specialists work dedicatedly for every child and nurture the best in them.
                                </p>
                                <p>
                                    Our team of specialists, teachers, psychologists, and educational experts understand the prevalence of learning disabilities, the effect of neuro divergence, and the needs of children. Our personal educators are highly trained and experienced in best pedagogy. All classes are curated to match the level of learning of a child.
                                </p>
                                <p>
                                    Dyslexia, Dysgraphia, Dyscalculia, Dysorthographia, Dyspraxia, AHDH, and other disabilities are taken into consideration to design potentially functional experiences. 

                                    It is our prime motto to understand, empathize, and assist children and their unique abilities. The specially curated learning program is scientifically proven and tested to provide skill-based learning into simple and effective techniques put forth in friendly and open sessions. You can also consult our experts to discuss the progress of your child, learn feedback, and discuss strategies for betterment. We are here to help you and your child adapt to newer and worthwhile mannerisms of learning and growing together in a healthy and aspiring ambiance.
                                </p>
                            </div>

                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
